# SEO (public routes)

- Metadata through the framework mechanism (Next `metadata`/`generateMetadata`, layout props, Django blocks) — server-rendered.
- Unique title (≤60) + description (70–160), one H1, canonical, OG/Twitter image, honest JSON-LD.
- Changing public routes or layouts → skill `seo-context`; gate `python3 rigor-os/tools/seo_context.py --check`.
- Never fake reviews/ratings/FAQs in structured data.
